.TH parsec-cli-device-list 1  "list " 
.SH NAME
parsec\-cli\-device\-list \- List all devices
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBparsec\-cli device list\fR [\fB\-c\fR|\fB\-\-config\-dir\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List all devices
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-config\-dir\fR \fI<CONFIG_DIR>\fR [default: /home/redacted/.config/parsec3/libparsec]
Parsec config directory
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBPARSEC_CONFIG_DIR\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
